## English

.NET 10 / React / PostgreSQL 17 / Docker, Onion/OOP/SOLID. Comments/replies, XHTML, CAPTCHA, sorting/pagination, one image or UTF-8 TXT, viewer/downloads and EN/RU/UA responsive UI. Layer-owned DTOs preserve JSON; backend config.json supports independent instances; structured console/file logs use configurable levels, rolling retention and InstanceId/TraceId.

[Installation/update](README.md) · [Configuration](docs/CONFIGURATION.md) · [Logging](docs/LOGGING.md) · [Current checks](docs/ACCEPTANCE_RECHECK.md). Keep project/environment/database volumes, apply migrations explicitly and preserve checkpoints/corpus; never reset shared data for tests.

Passed: 283 backend tests, 26 frontend, frontend/Docker builds, independent configuration/logging checks, Edge desktop/360px and 18 retained-million cases. Original rows/schema/history/environment/database volumes/checkpoints/preview preserved; dedicated persistent log volume added. Workbench GUI remains pending. Deployment 1.1.1.16 requires a target server.

